0708 * CARD INPUT ROUTINE                                                  SCIP3
0709 *******************************************************************   SCIP3
0710 I14       BLC  I18                 LAST CARD-BR TO END OF JOB.        SCIP3
0711           R                        READ A CARD                        SCIP3
0712           SS   2                   SELECT STACKER 2.                  SCIP3
0713 I98       A    '1',IPCT                                               SCIP3
0714           C    10,PREV                                                SCIP3
0715           BE   I98D                                                   SCIP3
0716           BH   I98A                                                   SCIP3
0717 I99       B    XXXX                READ INPUT EXIT.                   SCIP3
0718 * INPUT OUT OF SEQUENCE -                                             SCIP3
0719 * AN OUT OF SEQUENCE OF PROGRAM I.D. IN THE 1ST 8 POSITIONS OF THE    SCIP3
0720 *RECORD OR AN OUT OF SEQUENCE OF ABSTRACT INPUT WITHIN A PROGRAM      SCIP3
0721 *PACKAGE WOULD PRODUCE AN IMPROPER OUTPUT TAPE FILE.                  SCIP3
0722 * THESE 2 CONDITIONS WILL CAUSE THE PROGRAM TO COME TO HALT NUMBER    SCIP3
0723 *600. THE OPERATOR MAY PRESS START TO CONTINUE THE PROCESSING BUT     SCIP3
0724 *HE SHOULD MARK THE SPOT WHERE THE OUT OF SEQUENCE OCCURRED IN THE    SCIP3
0725 *CARD INPUT FILE AND SCRATCH THE OUTPUT TAPE AT END OF JOB.           SCIP3
0726 * AN OUT OF SEQUENCE FOUND ON A SORTED MAGNETIC TAPE FILE WOULD       SCIP3
0727 *INDICATE A WORTHLESS INPUT FILE AND SHOULD BE TREATED AS SUCH.       SCIP3
0728 * THE SEQUENCE WITHIN A PROGRAM PACKAGE OF THE INDEX CARDS A,B,C,D,   SCIP3
0729 *S, AND ZERO AND THE DELETE, INACTIVE OR CHANGE CONTROL CARDS IS      SCIP3
0730 *NOT IMPORTANT AND IS IGNORED BY THE PROGRAM.                         SCIP3
0731 *                                                                     SCIP3
0732 I98A      C    8,PREV-2            PROGRAM I.D. SEQUENCE.             SCIP3
0733           BH   I98B                                                   SCIP3
0734           C    PREV-1,'1'          CHECK FOR ABSTRACT.                SCIP3
0735           BH   I99                                                    SCIP3
0736 I98B      NOP  600                                                    SCIP3
0737           H                                                           SCIP3
0738           CW   EOJFLG    TELL END OF JOB ABOUT OUT OF SEQUENCE        SCIP3
0739           B    I99                                                    SCIP3
0740 * CHECK FOR DUPLICATE ABSTRACT INPUT RECORD NUMBERS.                  SCIP3
0741 * THE FIRST CARD IS USED-OTHERS ARE PRINTED AND DROPPED.              SCIP3
0742 I98D      C    9,'1'                                                  SCIP3
0743           BH   I99       BR TO EXIT IF NOT AN ABSTRACT.               SCIP3
0744           SBR  P05+3,MSG1                                             SCIP3
0745           B    P01                                                    SCIP3
0746 I98E      MLC  'N',P06                                                SCIP3
0747           B    I02                                                    SCIP3
0748 *******************************************************************   SCIP3
0749 * END OF JOB                                                          SCIP3
0750 *******************************************************************   SCIP3
0751 I18       SBR  B01+3,I20           SET B01SW TO RETURN TO I20.        SCIP3
0752           MLC  'N',E09             NOP INST WHICH WOULD NOP B01SW.    SCIP3
0753           MLC  BLANKS,B04A+4   SET B04 COMPARE BRANCH TO BRANCH       SCIP3
0754           MLC  B01+3          TO I20.                                 SCIP3
0755           MLC  'F',TRAIL+3         SET EOF TRAILER INDICATOR.         SCIP3
0756           B    E01                 BR TO PROCESS LAST RECORD.         SCIP3
0757 I20       MCS  OPCT,299                                               SCIP3
0758           MLC  'TAPE OUTPUT RECORD COUNT-',294                        SCIP3
0759           MCS  IPCT,252                                               SCIP3
0760           MLC  'INPUT RECORD COUNT-',246                              SCIP3
0761 *IF THE EOJFLG WM HAS BEEN REMOVED BY THE I98B ROUTINE THIS ROUTINE   SCIP3
0762 *WILL ADD THE BAD OUTPUT MESSAGE TO THE EXCEPTION LISTING AND         SCIP3
0763 *DESTROY THE DATA BY REWINDING THE TAPE BEFORE THE TRAILER WRITE.     SCIP3
0764           BW   I21,EOJFLG                                             SCIP3
0765           MLC  'BAD OUTPUT',222                                       SCIP3
0766           RWD  2                                                      SCIP3
0767 I21       W                                                           SCIP3
0768           B    W13                 WRITE TRAILER LABEL.               SCIP3
0769           NOP  999                 WRITE TRAILER AND EOJ.             SCIP3
0770           H                                                           SCIP3
0771           B    *-8                                                    SCIP3
