0807 *******************************************************************   SCIP3
0808 * REJECT ROUTINE                                                      SCIP3
0809 *******************************************************************   SCIP3
0810 * A CONTROL ROUTINE FOR PRINTING REJECTED PROGRAM I.D. CARD PACKETS   SCIP3
0811 *BY EXTRACTING THE CARD IMAGES FROM THE OUTPUT AREAS FOR ALL CARDS    SCIP3
0812 *EXCEPT ABSTRACTS. THIS ROUTINE FORCES THE ABSTRACT CARDS TO PRINT    SCIP3
0813 *DIRECTLY FROM THE INPUT AREA.                                        SCIP3
0814 * THE WRITE OUTPUT TAPE ROUTINE BRANCHES TO THIS ROUTINE INSTEAD      SCIP3
0815 *OF WRITING A TAPE RECORD IF THE REJECT FLAG HAS A WORD MARK.         SCIP3
0816 * E06 BRANCHES TO THIS ROUTINE WITH A 5 IN THE REJECT FLAG TO         SCIP3
0817 *REFLECT AN IMPROPER SET OF CARDS.                                    SCIP3
0818 R01       SW   PROP      TELL PRINT RTE NOT TO BUILD PRINT LINE.      SCIP3
0819           BCE  R50,REJECT,5                                           SCIP3
0820 R03       MLC  BLANKS,REJECT  TURN REJECT FLAG OFF                    SCIP3
0821           CW   REJECT                                                 SCIP3
0822           MLC  'CARDS REJECTED',299                                   SCIP3
0823 R09D      BCE  R30,FDEL,D          DELETE                             SCIP3
0824 R09I      BCE  R31,FINA,I          INACTIVE                           SCIP3
0825 R09M      BCE  R32,FCHA,M          CHANGE                             SCIP3
0826 R10A      BCE  R40,FA,A            A                                  SCIP3
0827 R10B      BCE  R41,FB,B            B                                  SCIP3
0828 R10C      BCE  R42,FC,C            C                                  SCIP3
0829 R10D      BCE  R43,FD,D            D                                  SCIP3
0830 R10S      BCE  R44,FS,S            S                                  SCIP3
0831 R10Z      BCE  R45,F0,0            ZER0                               SCIP3
0832 R11       MLC  BLANKS+8,F0    TURN OFF ALL CARD FLAGS BUT ABSTRACT.   SCIP3
0833           CW   PROP           TELL PRINT RTE TO BUILD PRINT LINE.     SCIP3
0834           B    X01            CLEAR CHANGE AND ADD OUTPUT AREA.       SCIP3
0835 *   PRINT ANY ABSTRACT CARDS FOR THIS REJECTED PACKET-                SCIP3
0836 R13       BCE  R20,FABS,           BACK TO NORMAL IF NO ABSTRACTS.    SCIP3
0837           MLC  BLANKS,FABS         CLEAR ABSTRACT FLAG.               SCIP3
0838 R15       SBR  P05+3,BLANKS+18                                        SCIP3
0839           B    P01                 TO PRINT RTE                       SCIP3
0840           B    I01                 GET INPUT RECORD                   SCIP3
0841           C    9,LTZ         COMPARE COL 9 TO ZERO                    SCIP3
0842           BL   R15            COL 9 IS NUMERIC 1 THRU 9.              SCIP3
0843 R20       MLC  'N',P06        SET FOR TRIPLE SPACE AFTER EACH SET     SCIP3
0844 *                             OF PROGRAM ID CARDS REJECTED.           SCIP3
0845           B    B04                 BACK TO NORMAL PROCESSING.         SCIP3
0846 * BUILD CARD IMAGES FROM OUTPUT AREAS AND PRINT                       SCIP3
0847 R30       MRCM DELETE+6,201        BUILD DELETE CARD IMAGE            SCIP3
0848           B    P01                                                    SCIP3
0849           B    R09I                                                   SCIP3
0850 R31       MRCM INACT+6,201         BUILD INACTIVE CARD IMAGE          SCIP3
0851           B    P01                                                    SCIP3
0852           B    R09M                                                   SCIP3
0853 R32       MLC  C0,218              BUILD CHANGE CONTROL CARD IMAGE    SCIP3
0854           B    P01                                                    SCIP3
0855           B    R10A                                                   SCIP3
0856 R40       MLC  CYRCMP,269          BUILD A CARD IMAGE                 SCIP3
0857           MLC  CARDA               MOVE CARD A IDENTIFICATION.        SCIP3
0858           MLC  CID                                                    SCIP3
0859           B    P01                                                    SCIP3
0860           B    R10B                                                   SCIP3
0861 R41       MLC  CMONIT,271          BUILD B CARD IMAGE                 SCIP3
0862           MLC  CFIELD                                                 SCIP3
0863           MLC  CARDB               MOVE CARD B IDENTIFICATION.        SCIP3
0864           MLC  CID                                                    SCIP3
0865           B    P01                                                    SCIP3
0866           B    R10C                                                   SCIP3
0867 R42       MLC  CDOC3,254           BUILD C CARD IMAGE                 SCIP3
0868           MLC  CDOC12                                                 SCIP3
0869           MLC  CNONLB                                                 SCIP3
0870           MLC  CARDC               MOVE CARD C IDENTIFICATION.        SCIP3
0871           MLC  CID                                                    SCIP3
0872           B    P01                                                    SCIP3
0873           B    R10D                                                   SCIP3
0874 R43       MLC  CMAT2,267           BUILD D CARD IMAGE                 SCIP3
0875           MLC  CARDD               MOVE CARD D IDENTIFICATION.        SCIP3
0876           MLC  CID                                                    SCIP3
0877           B    P01                                                    SCIP3
0878           B    R10S                                                   SCIP3
0879 R44       MLC  CSERCH,274          BUILD S CARD IMAGE                 SCIP3
0880           MLC  CARDS               MOVE CARD S IDENTIFICATION.        SCIP3
0881           MLC  CID                                                    SCIP3
0882           B    P01                                                    SCIP3
0883           B    R10Z                                                   SCIP3
0884 R45       MLC  CTITLE,268          BUILD ZER0 CARD                    SCIP3
0885           MLC  CARDZ               MOVE CARD ZERO IDENTIFICATION.     SCIP3
0886           MLC  CID                                                    SCIP3
0887           B    P01                                                    SCIP3
0888           B    R11                                                    SCIP3
0889 R50       MLC  FABS,300                                               SCIP3
0890           MLC  MSG5,289                                               SCIP3
0891           B    P01                                                    SCIP3
0892           B    R03                                                    SCIP3
0893 *******************************************************************   SCIP3
0894 * WRITE OUTPUT - SCREENED RECORDS TO MASTER UPDATE PROGRAM            SCIP3
0895 *******************************************************************   SCIP3
0896 W01       SBR  W99+3                                                  SCIP3
0897 W01A      BW   R01,REJECT     WM-REJECT ENTIRE PROG ID PACKAGE.       SCIP3
0898 W02       S    W02R                CLEAR ERROR RETRY COUNTER.         SCIP3
0899           WT   2,0+X2              WRITE.                             SCIP3
0900 W02K      BEF  W02J                BR IF END OF TAPE.                 SCIP3
0901           BER  W02L                BR IF WRITE ERROR.                 SCIP3
0902           B    W02R+1                                                 SCIP3
0903 W02J      BSP  2                   BACKSPACE TAPE 2.                  SCIP3
0904           S    W02Q                CLEAR ERASE FORWARD COUNTER.       SCIP3
0905           B    W05                 BR TO END OF TAPE RTE.             SCIP3
0906 W02L      BSP  2                   BACKSPACE TAPE 2.                  SCIP3
0907           A    *-6,W02R            ADD 1 TO RETRY COUNTER.            SCIP3
0908           BCE  W02M,W02R,B         BR IF RETRY COUNTER IS 2.          SCIP3
0909           B    W02K-8              TRY TO WRITE AGAIN.                SCIP3
0910 W02M      S    W02R                CLEAR RETRY COUNTER                SCIP3
0911           BCE  W02J+5,W02Q-1,3     BR IF 30 ERASE FORWARDS.           SCIP3
0912           SKP  2                   ERASE FORWARD.                     SCIP3
0913           A    *-6,W02Q            ADD 1 TO ERASE FORWARD COUNTER.    SCIP3
0914           B    W02K-8              TRY TO WRITE AGAIN.                SCIP3
0915 W02Q      DCW  =2                  COUNTER-ERASE FORWARDS PER REEL.   SCIP3
0916 W02R      DCW  +0                  COUNTER-RETRYS.                    SCIP3
0917           A    '1',BCOUNT     ADD ONE TO BLOCK COUNT                  SCIP3
0918           A    '1',OPCT       ADD ONE TO OUTPUT RECORD COUNT          SCIP3
0919           MLC  BLANKS+8,F0    TURN OFF ALL FLAGS EXCEPT ABSTRACT.     SCIP3
0920 W99       B    XXXX           WRITE TAPE 2 EXIT                       SCIP3
0921 * END OF TAPE ROUTINE                                                 SCIP3
0922 W05       B    W13       BR TO WRITE TRAILER LABEL SUB ROUTINE.       SCIP3
0923           NOP  503       MOUNT SCRATCH ON TAPE DRIVE 2                SCIP3
0924           H              HALT.                                        SCIP3
0925           B    W10       BR TO WRITE HEADER LABEL SUB ROUTINE.        SCIP3
0926           B    W02       WRITE RECORD NOT WRITTEN BECAUSE OF EOT.     SCIP3
0927 *******************************************************************   SCIP3
0928 * WRITE HEADER LABEL                                                  SCIP3
0929 *******************************************************************   SCIP3
0930 W10       SBR  W12+3                                                  SCIP3
0931 W10J      RWD  2                   REWIND.                            SCIP3
0932 W10J1     WT   2,HEADR             WRITE HEADER                       SCIP3
0933           BER  W10J2               BR ON ERROR.                       SCIP3
0934           BEF  W10J2               BR ON END OF TAPE.                 SCIP3
0935           A    '1',HEADR+18        ADD 1 TO REEL COUNT.               SCIP3
0936           B    W10J5               BR TO CLEAR CTR AND EXIT.          SCIP3
0937 * HEADER WRITE ERROR RTE - 4 RETRYS, 1 SKIP AND BLANK TAPE, THEN      SCIP3
0938 * 4 MORE RETRYS BEFORE HALT 59X. AT HALT MOUNT SCRATCH-PRESS START.   SCIP3
0939 W10J2     A    *-6,W10K4           ADD 1 TO ERROR COUNTER.            SCIP3
0940           BSP  2                   BACKSPACE                          SCIP3
0941           BCE  W10J3,W10K4,D       BR TO SKIP AFTER 4 RETRYS.         SCIP3
0942           BCE  W10J4,W10K4,H       BR TO MOUNT NEW TAPE.              SCIP3
0943           B    W10J1               BACK TO WRITE.                     SCIP3
0944 W10J3     SKP  2                   SKIP AND BLANK.                    SCIP3
0945           B    W10J1               BACK TO WRITE.                     SCIP3
0946 W10J4     RWU  2                   REWIND AND UNLOAD.                 SCIP3
0947           MLNS W10J1+3,*+4         SET UP HALT NUMBER.                SCIP3
0948           NOP  590                 HALT 59X TO MOUNT ANOTHER TAPE.    SCIP3
0949           H                                                           SCIP3
0950           S    W10K4               CLEAR ERROR COUNTER.               SCIP3
0951           B    W10J                BR TO TRY NEW TAPE.                SCIP3
0952 W10K4     DCW  =1                  ERROR RETRY COUNTER.               SCIP3
0953 W10J5     S    W10K4               CLEAR ERROR COUNTER.               SCIP3
0954 W12       B    XXXX      EXIT FROM WRITE HEADER LABEL ROUTINE         SCIP3
0955 *******************************************************************   SCIP3
0956 * WRITE TRAILER LABEL                                                 SCIP3
0957 *******************************************************************   SCIP3
0958 * THIS ROUTINE WILL WRITE TAPE MARK, TRAILER, ANOTHER TAPE MARK,      SCIP3
0959 * THEN REWIND AND UNLOAD THE TAPE.                                    SCIP3
0960 W13       SBR  W16+3                                                  SCIP3
0961           WTM  2                   WRITE TAPE MARK.                   SCIP3
0962 W13J1     WT   2,TRAIL             WRITE TRAILER.                     SCIP3
0963           BER  W13J3               BR ON ERROR.                       SCIP3
0964           BEF  *+1                 BR ON END OF TAPE.                 SCIP3
0965 W13J2     WTM  2                   WRITE TAPE MARK.                   SCIP3
0966           BER  *+1                 TURN OFF INDICATORS.               SCIP3
0967           BEF  *+1                                                    SCIP3
0968           B    W13J6               BR TO RWU AND EXIT.                SCIP3
0969 * WRITE TRAILER ERROR ROUTINE - 4 RETRYS, 1 SKIP AND BLANK TAPE,      SCIP3
0970 * THEN 4 MORE RETRYS, THEN BACKSPACE AND HALT 68X.                    SCIP3
0971 * AT HALT SET SS G OFF-PRESS START TO SKIP AND BLANK TAPE, ZERO       SCIP3
0972 * BACKSPACE COUNT AND RETURN TO ORIGINAL WRITE.                       SCIP3
0973 *  AT HALT SET SS G ON-PRESS START TO BYPASS TRAILER WRITE AND        SCIP3
0974 * WRITE TAPE MARK INSTEAD.                                            SCIP3
0975 W13J3     A    *-6,W13K3           ADD 1 TO ERROR COUNTER.            SCIP3
0976           BSP  2                   BACKSPACE.                         SCIP3
0977           BCE  W13J4,W13K3,D       BR TO SKIP AFTER 4 RETRYS.         SCIP3
0978           BCE  W13J5,W13K3,H       BR TO HALT.                        SCIP3
0979           B    W13J1               BR TO WRITE TRAILER.               SCIP3
0980 W13J4     SKP  2                   SKIP AND BLANK TAPE.               SCIP3
0981           B    W13J1               BR TO WRITE TRAILER.               SCIP3
0982 W13J5     MLNS W13J1+3,*+4         SET UP HALT NUMBER.                SCIP3
0983           NOP  680                                                    SCIP3
0984           H                                                           SCIP3
0985           BSS  W13J2,G             BR IF SENSE SW G ON.               SCIP3
0986           S    W13K3               CLEAR ERROR COUNTER.               SCIP3
0987           B    W13J4               BR TO SKIP AND BLANK.              SCIP3
0988 W13K3     DCW  =1                  ERROR COUNTER.                     SCIP3
0989 W13J6     S    W13K3               CLEAR ERROR COUNTER.               SCIP3
0990           RWU  2                   REWIND AND UNLOAD.                 SCIP3
0991           MLC  BLANKS+4,BCOUNT     CLEAR BLOCK COUNT.                 SCIP3
0992 W16       B    XXXX                WRITE TRAILER EXIT.                SCIP3
0993 *******************************************************************   SCIP3
0994 * CLEAR ADD OR CHANGE RECORD                                          SCIP3
0995 *******************************************************************   SCIP3
0996 X01       SBR  X99+3                                                  SCIP3
0997           SBR  X04+6,CEND                                             SCIP3
0998           MLC  LTB,CCTL+12                                            SCIP3
0999 X04       MLC  BLANKS,CEND                                            SCIP3
1000           SBR  X04+6                                                  SCIP3
1001           BCE  X04,CCTL+12,B                                          SCIP3
1002 X99       B    XXXX                                                   SCIP3
1003 *******************************************************************   SCIP3
1004 * OUTPUT AREA FOR WRITING CHANGE OR ADDITION  RECORDS                 SCIP3
1005 *******************************************************************   SCIP3
1006 CHADWD    DCW  'C00418'                                               SCIP3
1007 *SHARE CONTROL WORD CLUES                                             SCIP3
1008 * POS. 1- ALWAYS C                                                    SCIP3
1009 * POS. 2- ZERO SAYS COMPLETE LOGICAL RCD IN THIS PHYSICAL RCD.        SCIP3
1010 *         1 SAYS THIS IS 1ST PHYSICAL RCD OF A LOGICAL RCD.           SCIP3
1011 *         2 SAYS THIS IS AN INTERMEDIATE PHYSICAL RCD OF LOGICAL.     SCIP3
1012 *         3 SAYS THIS IS FINAL PHYSICAL RCD OF LOGICAL RCD.           SCIP3
1013 * POS 3-6 CONTAIN THE NUMBER OF REMAINING POS OF THE RECORD           SCIP3
1014 *         FOLLOWING THIS CONTROL WORD.                                SCIP3
1015           ORG  CHADWD-5                                               SCIP3
1016 CHAD      DA   1X424,G                           CARD AND FIELD NO.   SCIP3
1017 CC             1,2       SHARE CONTROL WORD IN POS 1-6.               SCIP3
1018 CCTL           3,6       SEE CHADWD DCW ABOVE FOR CONSTANT.           SCIP3
1019 CSTC           7,9       SUBMITTER S INSTALLATION CODE            2   SCIP3
1020 CID            14        PROGRAM I.D. / SUFFIX                    3   SCIP3
1021                16        BLANKS                                       SCIP3
1022                17      *-ALWAYS AN ASTERISK.                          SCIP3
1023 CTCODE         18        M INDICATES CHANGE * A INDICATES ADDITION    SCIP3
1024                19        A CARD PRESENT IN CHANGE PACKAGE.            SCIP3
1025                20        B CARD PRESENT IN CHANGE PACKAGE.            SCIP3
1026                21        C CARD PRESENT IN CHANGE PACKAGE.            SCIP3
1027                22        D CARD PRESENT IN CHANGE PACKAGE.            SCIP3
1028                23        S CARD PRESENT IN CHANGE PACKAGE.            SCIP3
1029 C0             24        0 CARD PRESENT IN CHANGE PACKAGE.            SCIP3
1030 CABS           37        START OF ABSTRACT                            SCIP3
1031 CSDA           53,61     ACCESSION OR SDA NUMBER AND SUFFIX    A  1   SCIP3
1032 CNAME          78        SUBMITTER S NAME                      A  4   SCIP3
1033 CAFFIL         90        SUBMITTER S AFFILIATION               A  5   SCIP3
1034 CAUTH          107       AUTHOR S NAME                         A  6   SCIP3
1035 CYRCMP         109       YEAR COMPLETE OR STATUS CODE          A  7   SCIP3
1036 CFIELD         110,124   FIELD OF APPLICATION                  B  9   SCIP3
1037                127       NOT USED                                     SCIP3
1038 CPSUBJ         128,130   PRIMARY SUBJECT CODE                  B 10   SCIP3
