1116 *******************************************************************   SCIP3
1117 * COUNTERS, CONSTANTS, ETC.                                           SCIP3
1118 *******************************************************************   SCIP3
1119 PAGECT    DCW  =4        PAGE COUNTER                                 SCIP3
1120 LINECT    DCW  +43       BODY LINE PER PAGE COUNTER.                  SCIP3
1121 LINEPA    DCW  +42       NUMBER OF BODY LINES PER PAGE DESIRED. IF    SCIP3
1122 *                        THE CONSTANT FOR LINEPA IS CHANGED THEN      SCIP3
1123 *                        THE CONSTANT FOR LINECT MUST ALSO BE         SCIP3
1124 *                        CHANGED. THE LINECT CONSTANT SHOULD BE       SCIP3
1125 *                        GREATER IN VALUE BY 1 THAN THE LINEPA        SCIP3
1126 *                        CONSTANT FOR PROPER HANDLING OF THE FIRST    SCIP3
1127 *                        PAGE.                                        SCIP3
1128 OPCT      DCW  =5                  OUTPUT RECORD COUNT.               SCIP3
1129 *******************************************************************   SCIP3
1130 * THESE EQUATES AND DCWS WERE ADDED TO SAVE 18 MEMORY POSITIONS,***   SCIP3
1131 * BY ELIMINATING THE LITERALS WHICH WERE A PORTION OF ANOTHER         SCIP3
1132 * LITERAL.                                                            SCIP3
1133 *******************************************************************   SCIP3
